"settings.etaProgrammaUzheByla" = "This app is already on the list — there is one row for it, change the profile there.";
"settings.etotRezhimNeobyazatelenPrompt" = "This mode is optional. The prompt is built by the agent you pick, and the profile prepares the text for whoever will run that prompt. Leave the path empty and the app finds the agent itself. Plain dictation always stays on this Mac; only prompt mode sends the transcript out, and only to the agent you chose. Ollama is the one option that sends nothing: it computes right here. The finished prompt is pasted without being sent anywhere, and the quality is checked here too — a claim with no literal footing in what you said is rejected no matter which agent wrote it.";
"settings.faylObychnyyJsonEgo" = "The file is plain JSON, you can open it and edit it by hand. This is the only copy of your replacements: everything else lives in system settings and disappears with them. On import, entries that match by phrase are taken from the file, and the ones missing from the file stay where they are — import never deletes. A broken file is rejected whole, with the number of the bad entry: half a restored dictionary is worse than an honest refusal. What you import reaches the settings after you press Save.";
"settings.faylObychnyyJsonEgo2" = "The file is plain JSON, you can edit it by hand. This is the only copy of your replacements. On import, entries that match by phrase are taken from the file, the rest stay where they are, import never deletes. A broken file is rejected whole, with the number of the bad entry. What you import reaches the settings after you press Save";
"settings.identifikatorEtoyProgrammyRazobr" = "Could not read this app's identifier.";
"settings.importSlovaryaIZagotovok" = "Import replacements and snippets";
"settings.importirovatSlovarIZagotovki" = "Import replacements and snippets from a file";
"settings.ispolnitelGotovogoPromptaPo" = "Who runs the finished prompt by default";
"settings.kakVyglyaditVolnaNa" = "How the wave looks on the recording plate";
"settings.kakoyDvizhokRaspoznavaniyaRechi" = "Which speech engine to use";
"settings.knopkiOchistitVseZdes" = "There is no «clear everything» button here on purpose: pressed without looking, it costs more than the gigabyte it saves. Picking what to delete lives where you can see what you are deleting — in the history window.";
"settings.modelLokalnogoAgenta" = "Model of the local agent";
"settings.nazhmiteSohranitChtobyZapisat" = " Press Save to write it down.";
"settings.parakeetBystreeV11" = "Parakeet is 11–15 times faster, but it transliterates English terms inside a non-English phrase: git rebase comes back spelled the way it sounded. Whisper large-v3 keeps them in Latin (19 percent errors on mixed speech against 44), but a half-minute dictation waits about 16 seconds. Both compute on this Mac; nothing leaves it.";
"settings.perelivyTriTonaVokrug" = "Shimmer — three tones around the mode color. Calm — the same tones, half the spread. Mono — no shimmer at all. The palette does not change the mode color: plain dictation stays warm, prompt stays cold, otherwise the plate would not tell you what is being recorded.";
"settings.perelivyTriTonaVokrug2" = "Shimmer: three tones around the mode color. Calm: the same tones, half the spread. Mono: no shimmer. The palette does not change the mode color — dictation stays warm, prompt stays cold";
"settings.perenesiteZapisVstrechi" = "Drop the meeting recording here";
"settings.podrobnoePoyasnenieKSekcii" = "More about this section";
"settings.podstanovkaPromptPeredaetTekst" = "{prompt} passes the text as its own argument. Without it the prompt goes to standard input. No quotes needed";
"settings.podstanovkiPromptTekstPrompta" = "Placeholders: {prompt} — the prompt text as its own argument. Without {prompt} the prompt goes to standard input. The command line is not glued from strings, so no quotes are needed.";
"settings.pokaNichegoNeZanyato" = "Nothing is taking up space yet: no models, no dictations on the disk.";
"settings.pokaPustoNadiktovannoePoyavitsya" = "Empty for now. What you dictate will show up here.";
"settings.pokazyvatOknoEsliTekst" = "Show a window if the text did not get pasted";
"settings.pokazyvatOknoSTekstom" = "Show a window with the text when pasting fails";
"settings.profilVybiraetsyaPoPrilozheniyu" = "The profile is chosen by the app that is in front when you press the key. The window, the field and the text of that app are never read. The app is asked once and forgotten right away: the profile goes to the disk and the log, not the app's name. Apps outside the list get the default profile";
"settings.proiznesennayaFrazaZamenyaetsyaS" = "The phrase you say is replaced with the text you saved — that is how letterheads, details and standard wordings get pasted. The match is exact and on word boundaries: «sue» inside «issue» will not fire, and case does not matter. Snippets and replacements are applied in one pass, so the dictionary does not rewrite the snippet text afterwards. The raw transcript on the disk stays untouched, and prompt mode does not see snippets at all.";
"settings.proiznesennayaFrazaZamenyaetsyaS2" = "The phrase you say is replaced with the text you saved: letterheads, details, standard wordings. The match is exact and on word boundaries, case does not matter. Snippets and replacements are applied in one pass, the dictionary does not rewrite the snippet text. The raw transcript on the disk does not change, prompt mode does not see snippets";
"settings.promptRezhimNeobyazatelenPrompt" = "Prompt mode is optional. The prompt is built by the agent you pick, the profile prepares the text for whoever runs it. Leave the path empty and the app finds the agent itself. Plain dictation is always local. Only prompt mode sends the transcript out, and only to the agent you chose. Ollama computes on this Mac and sends nothing. The finished prompt is pasted without being sent, and a claim with no literal footing in what you said is rejected no matter the agent";
"settings.putKIspolnyaemomuFaylu" = "Path to the agent's executable";
"settings.rasshifrovkaIdetNaEtom" = "Transcription runs on this Mac with the same engine as dictation. The audio is never sent anywhere, and the file itself stays where it was.";
"settings.raznicaSDiktovkoyNazvana" = "The difference from dictation is stated plainly: a meeting keeps both the audio and the transcript. Plain dictation never keeps audio. The files sit on your disk in the clear with 0600 permissions: disk encryption is FileVault's job, not the app's.";
