"prompt.appProfiles.explainer" = "Dictate into a code editor and the prompt is built for Codex; dictate into mail and it is the general one. %@ looks only at which application is in front: no window, no field and no text of another program is ever read. The application is asked for once, at the moment you press the key, and forgotten straight away: what goes to disk and to the log is the chosen profile, not the name of the program. Applications that are not on the list are not affected: they get the default profile.";
